Encoding: UTF-8
Language: id
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, tikzDevice, kableExtra
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: Quarto (>= 1.4), XeLaTeX, LaTeX package
        'algorithm2e'; R packages knitr, rmarkdown, and tikzDevice are
        required to render the generated thesis project
URL: https://github.com/madsyair/skripsistis
BugReports: https://github.com/madsyair/skripsistis/issues
